      <title>Applying a Bound Tuple</title>
      <para>A tuple bound to a name stands for its components where it is applied: <literal>f args</literal> calls f with them, and <literal>Point(args)</literal> builds the record from them. Its components are evaluated once, when it is bound.</para>
